<Report ScriptLanguage="CSharp" ReportInfo.Description="Demonstrates a simple Map object that is not bound to data. To create a map:&#13;&#10;- put the Map object on the report page;&#13;&#10;- doubleclick the object to invoke its editor;&#13;&#10;- click the &quot;Add&quot; button to add a map layer;&#13;&#10;- select ESRI shapefile (.shp/.dbf files).&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Note: do not use shapefiles with large number of polygons (more than 10000). This will slow down the report.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Learn more in the documentation https://www.fast-report.com/public_download/docs/FRNet/online/en/UserManual/en-US/DataBand/MapReports.html" ReportInfo.Created="04/28/2012 01:31:18" ReportInfo.Modified="03/28/2023 21:09:45" ReportInfo.CreatorVersion="1.0.0.0">
